## Layout

| Path | Contents |
|---|---|
| `crates/` | workspace members; each has its own `AGENTS.md` |
| `proto/` | protobuf contracts (if any); code is generated in `build.rs` |
| `sekvent.toml` | gate, coverage, harness and task configuration |
| `.remote-build.toml` | remote builder (rrb) configuration |
| `.sekvent/run.sh` | installs the locked cargo-sekvent in containers and CI |
| `Dockerfile` | release image build (no deploy tooling here) |

## Rules

- Code, comments, identifiers and docs are in English.
- `src/main.rs` stays thin: telemetry, config, `serve`. Logic lives in the
  library so tests can reach it.
- Wire contracts (proto packages, JSON shapes, header names, error reasons)
  change only compatibly; a breaking change is a new version.
- Dependency versions come from `[workspace.dependencies]`; crates use
  `{ workspace = true }`.

